            "body": "Just tested the fix, but it doesn't seem to work if you don't start with a multicursor enabled, i.e. if you skip the first `Q` from above and do the `VjI` on 2 lines of text you get the behavior from before the fix.\n\nThus in the same file do with the same mapping do `gg$jjjVjI` you end up with\n```\ntest\nnvim\n\nbadtesbadt\nnvibadm\n```",
